@startuml lez-state-route-compliance
title LEZ-001 - Route.lezStatus lifecycle (proposal)

!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

[*] --> UNCHECKED : route materialised\n(callback / saved revision)
UNCHECKED --> COMPLIANT : ComplianceChecker: no violation
UNCHECKED --> VIOLATION : ZONE_ACCESS | ZONE_TRANSIT | LEZ_DATA_MISSING
COMPLIANT --> STALE : ruleset hash changed\n(template version, copy edit, permit,\nvehicle legal data, zone enabled/disabled)
VIOLATION --> STALE : ruleset hash changed
STALE --> COMPLIANT : re-check (send or on demand)
STALE --> VIOLATION : re-check
VIOLATION --> VIOLATION : edit saved as new revision\n(new route rows, re-certified)
COMPLIANT --> [*] : sent to driver

note right of COMPLIANT
  Only COMPLIANT routes can be sent,
  and only after a fresh re-check
  at send time.
end note
@enduml
